Description: Fix CVE-2020-10673 — block caucho-quercus (com.caucho.config.types.ResourceRef)
 polymorphic-typing gadget. jackson-databind 2.3.1 predates the SubTypeValidator
 denylist infrastructure, so a self-contained denylist guard is added at the
 attacker-controlled type-id resolution site (ClassNameIdResolver._typeFromId),
 which is also the delegation target for MinimalClassNameIdResolver and both
 public typeFromId overloads. Blocked type ids now raise IllegalArgumentException
 before the class is loaded, preventing SSRF / arbitrary object deserialization
 via default typing.
Origin: ai-synthesized, CVE-2020-10673
Author: Root.io Novel Patcher <security@root.io>
Last-Update: 2026-08-19

